WEBVTT

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:04.230
Kou?

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.440
Yuuri?

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:07.600
Huh?

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.600
Oh, there you are.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.650
What happened? You're taking so long.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.860
But where's Yuuri?

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.880
We weren't doing anything.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:34.010
Did something happen... with Kou?

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.660
Nothing at all.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.400
<i>That doesn't feel like...</i>

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.430
<i>"nothing at all"...</i>

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:34.810
There... that's right... 
this one's okay, too... hmm?

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:36.370
This one's...

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.370
<i>Kou...</i>

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.840
<i>And Yuuri...</i>

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:41.520
<i>What happened between them?</i>

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.670
<i>She averted her eyes again!</i>

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:54.230
<i>What is it? What? What happened?!</i>

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.820
<i>Did one of them confess to the other?</i>

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.410
<i>Or is it possible, they...</i>

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.200
<i>No, no! Never mind!</i>

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.230
<i>So anxious...</i>

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.420
By the way, how'd you solve this one?

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.370
Just like you said before.

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:13.280
<i>I wonder, does Kou...</i>

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:15.930
<i>...like Yuuri?</i>

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:18.510
What's with you, Kou?

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.670
You pick this stuff up so quickly.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:23.970
Is your only problem that 
you don't listen in class?

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:26.270
Why'd you start hating studying so much?

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.680
I didn't come to hate it so much...

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:33.010
...as I just stopped needing it.

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:33.780
Huh?

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:36.860
That's right.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:40.790
If I don't need it, 
why am I bothering with this?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.030
It's stupid.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.160
No!

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:48.910
If you don't try now, little by little,

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.370
you really won't advance 
to the next grade level!

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.610
I couldn't bear that!

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:57.450
That wouldn't make anyone happy!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.430
Yuuri...

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.250
<i>Eh?</i>

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:05.370
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:10.810
<i>What... is this vibe between them?</i>

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:15.270
Makita's a more passionate 
person than I thought!

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.840
You're right about that.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.060
You want us all to enter 
third year together, right?

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.570
And if you do bad next term too,

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.300
you'll need to do supplementary lessons 
during summer vacation, you know.

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:28.370
If that happened, we couldn't 
all hang out together.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:29.830
That'd be nice!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.830
I'd like us all to hang out together!

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.200
What?

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:35.450
Please don't decide things without asking...

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:38.650
Hm... just make it any time except Obon.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:43.570
So try just a little bit longer with us, okay?

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:49.780
Sure.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.560
But for today, I'm tired.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.240
Sorry.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:07.520
Well, one way or another, we got a lot done.

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.150
Yeah, I guess.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:13.170
But you got so passionate, Yuuri.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.160
It was a little unexpected.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:21.080
Something did happen with you and Kou, right?

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.250
<i>That pause means...</i>

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.510
It's nothing.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:36.040
<i>...that something did happen 
that I don't know about.</i>

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:44.740
Shuuei Line - Sakigatani Station

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:41.880
Later!

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.250
Good work today.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:44.740
Bye bye, Futaba-chan!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:45.830
Bye bye!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.210
<i>I really do have to know!</i>

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:09.130
Kou. Sorry. What?

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:11.650
Were you just about to head out?

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:13.140
Sorry...

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.440
Not yet.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.930
It's a little later, so it's fine.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:18.760
What's wrong?

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.150
U-Um...

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:28.400
I-I think I forgot my cell phone!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:31.750
Oh, really? It's probably in my room.

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:34.230
I'll give it a call and see.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.210
I'll check my room.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.630
And... could I use the bathroom?

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.990
Can I have a glass of water?

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:54.600
<i>I can't bring myself to ask...</i>

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:54.750
<b>7th Cup</b>

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:54.920
<b>7th Cup</b>

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:55.930
<b>7th Cup</b>

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:59.350
So? What do you really want?

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:02.530
It was funny, so I didn't say anything, but...

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:04.020
<i>He got me, huh?</i>

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:04.020
<b>D'oh</b>

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:11.180
Kou...

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.810
Did something happen with Yuuri?

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:21.330
It's really nothing.

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.090
<i>The same pause as Yuuri's.</i>

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:29.580
<i>It's not fair. Why won't they tell me?</i>

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:35.970
But Yuuri's acting kind of strange...

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:40.100
Although she says nothing happened.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:44.900
If Makita says nothing happened, she's right.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.450
It's nothing for you to worry about.

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:51.320
<i>I feel like I'm being left out of something.</i>

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:53.480
So this conversation is over.

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:55.820
<i>I'm flustered.</i>

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.120
And also... I want to know...

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:04.080
...the reason why you changed.

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:09.620
That again?

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:14.800
I told you to stop searching 
for the old me, didn't I?

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:17.350
I'm not searching.

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:21.200
I'm not searching for the Kou 
from those days anymore.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:24.480
I just want to know you 
as you are now, properly.

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:27.830
I want to know everything 
that's happened to you.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:35.610
With most people,

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.900
if you talk to them a certain amount,

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.900
then start to avoid them,

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:42.290
they won't try to get involved anymore.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.860
You're really something.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.040
<i>Is he...</i>

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:50.700
<i>...being sarcastic to try to change the subject?</i>

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:52.010
<i>But I won't lose!</i>

00:08:57.840 --> 00:08:58.750
Fine.

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:01.310
What? Kou?

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:09.530
Hey! What are you do—

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.760
My mom.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:22.820
Don't give me that expression.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:27.220
It's not exactly something 
I was hiding, but...

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:31.050
But I wasn't sure how to talk about it.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:33.470
And I knew

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:36.460
it would make you have that expression.

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:40.230
Kou—

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.320
Makita...

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:45.240
...had exactly the same expression you do now.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.860
<i>Back there, Yuuri found out...</i>

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.470
<i>...about Kou's mom.</i>

00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:02.950
<i>Yuuri was probably hesitant to talk 
about it without his permission.</i>

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:04.580
It's nothing.

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:10.440
<i>And yet... I...</i>

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:14.420
<i>I was so flustered about what 
their relationship was...</i>

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:22.230
I'm sorry.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:24.390
What are you apologizing for?

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:27.880
<i>Kou and Yuuri both...</i>

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:32.700
<i>...were thinking about the feelings 
of people other than themselves.</i>

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:39.850
<i>But I was only thinking about myself.</i>

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:43.440
You sure do cry a lot.

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.410
So, so annoying.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:49.640
Sorry.

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:01.320
You're hopeless.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:13.690
You're not...

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.140
...going to quit school, are you?

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:27.660
Do you not want to be with us?

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:31.670
I...

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:37.760
I want to be with you, Kou!

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:24.260
Ta-dah!

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:31.520
H-Hey!

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:34.190
It's not like that.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:38.410
She started crying when 
she found out about Mom.

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:48.530
I see.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.340
Oops. I'd better get going.

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:56.790
Where are you going?

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:58.790
Not there again...

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.740
Today it's my job.

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:01.760
Job?

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:04.720
Oh, you've got your job today?

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:07.170
You want me to drive you?

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:08.500
Nah.

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:12.980
Just drop her off for me, okay?

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.770
Wait!

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:38.810
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:47.500
Tanaka-sensei, do you not get along with Kou?

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:58.690
I think Kou can't forgive me.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:13:59.510
What?

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:02.490
From when our parents divorced.

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:05.650
Kou.

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:07.950
Take care of Mom, okay?

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:10.150
I will.

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:22.170
Because with those words, 
in what would become the hardest time...

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.520
...I put everything on Kou.

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:31.640
Was it a right here?

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:33.100
Yes.

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:48.480
When Mom got sick and was hospitalized,

00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:56.490
I had just become a teacher.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:04.020
I could only visit the hospital in Nagasaki,
where they'd moved to, once in a while.

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:23.480
Seeing my mother so much 
thinner every visit...

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.560
It was very hard on me.

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:34.470
I was always scared of entering
that hospital room.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.180
Really...

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:39.330
...scared.

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.630
And he had to...

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:48.280
...feel things like that every day,
 all by himself.

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:59.240
Kou's really a kind, good kid. So...

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:00.230
I know.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:08.930
I know.

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:13.700
Right?

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:18.770
He's a good kid.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.110
Thanks.

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:43.640
Caring for things brings a lot of trouble.

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:52.660
<i>Those are the words of someone who 
knows the fear of losing someone.</i>

00:16:56.260 --> 00:17:00.310
<i>That's what made Kou who he is now, right?</i>

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:04.490
<i>Kou...</i>

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.580
<i>He's been walking through a night</i>

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:20.520
<i>I don't know anything about, hasn't he?</i>

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:25.720
<i>That's why...</i>

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.890
But for today, I'm tired.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:33.940
Sorry.

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:35.780
Nah.

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.780
Just drop her off for me, okay?

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:41.510
Wait!

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.400
<i>But, you know...</i>

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:50.520
<i>Kou makes mistakes.</i>

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:53.670
<i>No matter how much he 
pretends he doesn't care,</i>

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.520
<i>no matter how coldly 
he tries to act...</i>

00:17:57.150 --> 00:18:00.540
<i>...at the end of the day, he's kind.</i>

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:02.760
<i>I know that.</i>

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.270
Sorry.

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:18.640
Futaba-chan, what's wrong?

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:20.450
Why are you apologizing?

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:23.650
Kou told me...

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.530
...about his mom.

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:32.750
You weren't sure if it was okay 
to tell me without his permission.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.310
That's why you said it was nothing, right?

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:42.000
But I just got so worried about it...

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.550
It's pathetic, huh?

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:48.350
Not at all.

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.760
I'm the same way.

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:56.910
Whenever I see how well you 
and Mabuchi-kun get along,

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:00.160
I feel like I'm at a disadvantage.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.450
It makes me really anxious.

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:12.530
I'm the one who said "no hard feelings"...

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:15.610
But the truth is, I'm always jealous.

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:17.460
I'm always anxious.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:24.230
Part of the reason I didn't tell you
 about Mabuchi-kun's mom

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:30.200
was because I wanted to become 
more special than you.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:34.250
So...

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:38.490
when you apologize to me like that... it hurts.

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:40.470
I'm sorry.

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.170
I hate this.

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:57.130
Why did we both have to 
fall for the same person?

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.440
I hate it!

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:07.090
Futaba-chan...

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.500
But Yuuri! I love you, okay?

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:21.430
I love you, too, Futaba-chan!

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.170
Should we go back?

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:42.820
Yeah.

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:51.230
Hey...

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:53.180
What's this?

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:55.000
Ahem!

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:58.570
I organized the math lessons to make them
 extremely easy to understand!

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:01.020
Please take it without hesitation.

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:04.110
How kind I am!

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.360
I so don't need this.

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:09.390
Hey! Do you know how hard I worked 
getting that stuff organized?

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:12.110
You're expecting a lot of gratitude 
for something I didn't even ask for!

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:13.790
What was that?

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.900
When someone does something...

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:17.960
Oh, I see! Oh, I see!

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:17.960
<i>There, you see?</i>

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:24.210
<i>No matter how cold he acts, 
at the end of the day, he's kind.</i>

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:28.110
Maybe I'll organize the science lessons, too.

00:21:28.110 --> 00:21:30.140
Oh, please do!

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.740
When are we having the next study meeting?

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:34.600
Mabuchi-kun, when are you free?

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:37.660
Next time, we should do it with dinner.
 I'll make my best dish!

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:41.030
<i>If Kou's still walking through the night,</i>

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:45.130
<i>we'll be the sign to lead him to the exit.</i>

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:46.990
That's disgusting.

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:54.540
Let me think about it.

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:40.930
Next Episode . . .

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:31.580
It's too late!

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:39.120
The fact that you're scared shows that 
you already care about us!
